{"title":"Vintage Eastern European Matchbox Labels (1950-1980s)","link":"https://kottke.org/26/09/vintage-eastern-european-matchbox-labels-1950-1980s","date":1788993840000,"content":"\n         \t<p>Over on Flickr, Jane McDevitt maintains <a href=\"https://www.flickr.com/photos/maraid/albums/72157594234429063\">a huge collection of 20th century matchbox label art from Eastern Europe</a>, over 4000 photos in all. Some of the labels <a href=\"https://matchbloc.com\">are available as prints</a>. They <a href=\"https://matchbloc.com/products/matchbloc-book\">did a book too</a>, but it’s sold out. It was really difficult to narrow these down to some of my favorites, but I managed.</p>\n\t<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none//plus/misc/images/editor-1788989507-87f8a427.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none//plus/misc/images/editor-1788989507-87f8a427.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none//plus/misc/images/editor-1788989507-87f8a427.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>\n\t<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none//plus/misc/images/editor-1788989524-a4d578a7.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none//plus/misc/images/editor-1788989524-a4d578a7.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none//plus/misc/images/editor-1788989524-a4d578a7.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>\n\t<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none//plus/misc/images/editor-1788989541-52b28015.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none//plus/misc/images/editor-1788989541-52b28015.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none//plus/misc/images/editor-1788989541-52b28015.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>\n\t<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none//plus/misc/images/editor-1788989553-0961e128.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none//plus/misc/images/editor-1788989553-0961e128.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none//plus/misc/images/editor-1788989553-0961e128.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>\n\t<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none//plus/misc/images/editor-1788989571-8cdd5318.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none//plus/misc/images/editor-1788989571-8cdd5318.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none//plus/misc/images/editor-1788989571-8cdd5318.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>\n\t<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none//plus/misc/images/editor-1788989598-449dd8a8.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none//plus/misc/images/editor-1788989598-449dd8a8.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none//plus/misc/images/editor-1788989598-449dd8a8.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>\n\t<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none//plus/misc/images/editor-1788989643-e921a279.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none//plus/misc/images/editor-1788989643-e921a279.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none//plus/misc/images/editor-1788989643-e921a279.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>\n\t<p>P.S. I wrote this whole post and then discovered that <a href=\"https://kottke.org/21/11/mid-century-modern-matchbox-labels-from-eastern-bloc-countries-1950s-1980s\">I’d written about this collection before</a>. But I picked different labels so it’s all good.\n</p>\n \n\n        \n         <p><strong>Tags:</strong> <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/art\">art</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/illustration\">illustration</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/Jane%20McDevitt\">Jane McDevitt</a></p>\n        \n    ","author":"Jason Kottke","siteTitle":"Kottke","siteHash":"89a883271b4598f9b33ebe87be70d38557bcd266e68aee521a8f93622e0ab723","entryHash":"4e66cfbe71ee43ad8eebb5c041d80039e9366be758d17bd8a6197ab7baafc575","category":"Sites"}